cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "groundinsight: Simulation of grounding systems in electrical power grids"
abstract: >-
  Python package for analyzing grounding systems during single-phase-to-ground
  faults. Computes earth potential rise, reduction factors and grounding
  impedances for networked grounding systems over arbitrary bus/branch
  topologies (line, ring, mesh).
type: software
authors:
